<urn:atm:triage:finding/AV4-B2>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AV4-B2" ;
  triage:title "D5/A6 reader-lane diagnostics are fabricated placeholder zeros that read as healthy evidence" ;
  triage:description "scripts/smoke/read_benchmark.py _diagnostics() (:354-367) hardcodes wait_ms {0,0,0}, saturation_events 0, quarantine_gauge 0, wal_health {status: not-exposed-by-cli}; RequestObservation.timed_out (:114) is never set true so deadline_expiries is structurally always 0. A committed report would show zero saturation/quarantine/WAL activity during a genuine regression. Missing vs AV.1a D5 names: in-flight count, retired/replaced workers, quarantine-exhausted rejections, WAL last-checkpoint outcome/frame count, three deadline-outcome categories. Fix: emit explicit null/unimplemented with the full AV.1a D5 field-name skeleton (never fabricated zeros) or wire a real metrics surface. Source: quality-mgr phase-av-sprint-av4-qa-r1, PR #1114 (REQ-AV4-1, ARCH-AV4-3)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-av" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "AV4" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
